_fb_port/

# Verification-run output (screenshots, report.json) from drift-reconciliation and
# smoke runs. Root canon's SWEEP gate 2 forbids `verify-out/` paths by name, so while
# this directory is untracked-but-not-ignored, any run that writes it blocks every
# sweep of this repo until it is cleaned up by hand. OPS74-Q2 hit exactly that: a
# concurrent reconcile session dropped 166 files here mid-manifest. Ignoring it makes
# gate 1 satisfiable by construction. (ORACLE_MF v0.56 ruling c, applied OPS76.)
verify-out/
